  "issue_title": "Harden PR queue matching against ambiguous short titles",
  "issue_body": "**Context**\n\nThis PR correctly adds deterministic reconciliation after model planning, but the current token-overlap matcher can become imprecise for very short or generic PR titles. Tightening the matcher will preserve the new queue guarantee while reducing false positives as the open-PR queue grows.\n\n**Acceptance criteria**\n\n- [ ] Prefer explicit PR number references when present in the plan item title or rationale.\n- [ ] Add tests for one-token PR titles and generic overlapping words.\n- [ ] Ensure unrelated feature work is not down-weighted to triage solely because of weak token overlap.\n- [ ] Keep the existing acceptance cases from PR #76 passing.\n\n**Pointers**: `agent/planner.py` functions `_matched_pr`, `_significant_tokens`, and `reconcile_plan_with_queue`; `tests/test_planner.py`.",
